# Local output from the scripts/verify_*.py diagnostics. These carry raw,
# unscrubbed data — real workout ids, titles, notes and training figures —
# with none of the scrubbing the committed fixture gets. Keep them out of the
# repo; they are meant to be read once and deleted.
hevy-report*.txt
metrics-report*.txt

# Coverage artefacts. `.coverage` is a binary SQLite file written by
# pytest-cov; it is a local measurement, not a source file.
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
